{} (:about "|Per-backend exclusions for scripts/run-core-tests.mjs. Keys under :tests are test ids (namespace/definition#name); :tags maps a test tag to a reason. Every reason starts with a category: unsupported (the backend explicitly rejects the construct), parity (the backend disagrees with native; fix in a separate issue), host (needs a host capability the replay does not provide), replay (an artifact of replaying outside the owning namespace).")
  :native $ {}
  :js $ {}
    :tests $ {} (|calcit.core/deftrait#requires-head-accepts-bare-and-quoted "|parity: JS codegen cannot emit the raw `macroexpand` syntax node used by this test")
  :wasm $ {}
    :tags $ {} $ :enum-definition-equality "|unsupported: first-class EnumDef creation requires &enum-def:new, rejected by WASM codegen (#1863)"
    :tests $ {} (|calcit.core/&+#preserves-primitive-schema-in-local-binding "|unsupported: unsupported WASM expression: (&proc &+)")
      |calcit.core/&buf-list:to-list#freezes-heterogeneous-members-in-order "|unsupported: E_WASM_NIL_TYPE_EVIDENCE: = requires statically non-colliding list element types for open List<Dynamic> containing scalars"
      |calcit.core/&display-stack#returns-unit-and-evaluates-legacy-arguments "|unsupported: unsupported proc in WASM: &display-stack"
      |calcit.core/option:unwrap-or#erased-consumer-rewrites-keep-results "|unsupported: unsupported proc in WASM: ref"
      |calcit.core/struct-match#evaluates-subject-once-and-keeps-body-errors "|unsupported: first-class local prototype uses unsupported proc in WASM: &struct-def:new"
      |calcit.core/struct-match#rejects-invalid-input-with-original-failure-text "|unsupported: E_WASM_UNSUPPORTED_TRY: try is retired on WASM/WASI"
      |calcit.core/assert#keeps-unit-and-original-failure-text "|unsupported: E_WASM_UNSUPPORTED_TRY: try is retired on WASM/WASI"
      |calcit.core/dbg#registered-log-propagates-argument-error "|unsupported: E_WASM_UNSUPPORTED_TRY: try is retired on WASM/WASI; native/JS exercise the handler and WASI separately verifies the uncaught trap before output"
      |calcit.core/pairs-map#retains-malformed-pair-failure "|unsupported: E_WASM_UNSUPPORTED_TRY: try is retired on WASM/WASI"
      |calcit.core/pairs-map#preserves-empty-duplicate-and-nil-pairs "|unsupported: E_WASM_NIL_TYPE_EVIDENCE: = requires statically non-colliding Map value types for open Map<Dynamic, Dynamic> containing scalars"
      |calcit.core/any?#short-circuits-list-set-and-map "|unsupported: unsupported proc in WASM: ref"
      |calcit.core/every?#short-circuits-list-set-and-map "|unsupported: unsupported proc in WASM: ref"
